# ==============================================================================
# PATGOLITO - Netlify Single Page Application (SPA) Rewrite Configuration
# Operating Entity: Zoago Logistics Solutions Private Limited
# ==============================================================================
# This rule tells Netlify to rewrite any URL request that doesn't match a static
# file to /index.html with an HTTP 200 status code.
#
# This ensures:
# 1. Direct URL access to /privacy, /terms, /delete-account, /about loads the app.
# 2. Browser refresh (F5) on any route keeps the user on their active page.
# 3. External links and bookmarks land directly on the correct React component.
# 4. Unknown routes are processed by the React client-side router, preserving
#    the official PATGOLITO custom 404 page instead of Netlify's default error page.
# 5. Static assets (.js, .css, .png, .jpg, robots.txt, sitemap.xml) are served
#    directly by Netlify's CDN edge without triggering the rewrite.
# ==============================================================================

/api/*    /.netlify/functions/admin-api/:splat    200
/*        /index.html                             200
